{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22112","headline":"松声 · 白居易","name":"松声","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"月好好独坐，双松在前轩。\n西南微风来，潜入枝叶间。\n萧寥发爲声，半夜明月前。\n寒山飒飒雨，秋琴泠泠弦。\n一闻涤炎暑，再听破昏烦。\n竟夕遂不寐，心体俱翛然。\n南陌车马动，西邻歌吹繁。\n谁知兹檐下，满耳不爲喧。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22112.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22112","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}